File: bfd/coff-x86_64.c
Line: 146
Function: coff_amd64_reloc
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: When handling R_AMD64_IMAGEBASE for ELF flavor and __ImageBase is undefined, the code writes through error_message without checking if the pointer is NULL: *error_message = ... This can dereference a NULL pointer because callers of the BFD relocation hook may pass a NULL error_message to ignore detailed diagnostics.

